Key Takeaway

Azure DNS provides highly available and scalable DNS hosting for Azure and internet-facing applications. By creating DNS zones, managing records, and leveraging alias records, Azure Administrators can simplify DNS management, improve reliability, and ensure seamless connectivity between domain names and Azure resources.
